<description>&lt;p&gt;A covert operation seized a Lockerbie bombing suspect on Libyan territory, showing continued security actions against international terrorism. Khalifa Haftar’s son met the Inspector General of Morocco’s Royal Armed Forces and later met Syria’s foreign minister in Libya, linking Libyan factions to regional actors. Over 130 migrants died when a boat capsized off the African coast, and mines under fire contest gold control in the Egypt-Sudan-Libya border triangle. The government warned of penalties for unauthorized protests, and there were two battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikgFBVV95cUxOQ0dyell2ZDJZNURkM0JfT25LUXFmT0JOR2w2OHhINHlnVWFSOUhEemZNTFQ1Q1dyUF9HdmlNal9OMjNyaS1OV1ktRHlWZFctSks3aVNxRURXRTRLbENsSzJjUUlodUZPT1NLNnk2SnQ5OUV3YmQ4aFVMeVJHMzlFSWJWUUt5TXoyLTFsSmp2R2VpQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Atlantic&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxNUlFjRU90YVluRW4zbXo2ZC1lV2QyM2NubFF4OGNZMVZ4aDBubEMwalVaSUpYR3BDTjhVYzJjbWthaTc4cmk3OUlubVlYUS0yV1RidU81VnFVQ05ncXlJYzJmQXZGb29LeC1QQzdTVHZRUkZSOWZFTUFEREh0NjFwVDJIRERzajQySXJLMmxxVnZEWDg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Yahoo&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxQV0xjaExIS3RnUU9ELTNiU2o1bzVtNk5NMFJPR0EtcDN6NXl1ZGZYeFJQOEN2aUc5UGtMVnQ2dDR6STVyemZJQjktalZVLWRuX0lEaVM5ekQybkRfaGRSazE1LU9nbE96RTJtZ1F6YU9rd0ZxNXNsTkQtVUhTQ2hYNWxGejBCRkw5SjlCeEx3MEFhMk0xZjNwYzFlanQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Yabiladi.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxNODVzVi1iNGhsNVRibWJVYmRmcjNVbzAzSy1VeGdRVlpRdm5lOXprRlJnMGFxOGcwTVhxZVUtSDFKS0tpaFpmeG9sVXgzVEZZM2s4UFUzbHgzcUNvZFF5SFgxeTVUanhKNUVoeWtpaFVydzNESm4wdFZKXzlyeDZiMUQ2ZWk4bTVE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Island.lk&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Businessday NG&lt;